ual number of visits in which an HIV test was not performed\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"This methodology was used because the outcome, visits with an HIV test, had unweighted cell sizes <30 for several subgroups.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"All analyses used weighting to account for the complex sampling design.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Univariate logistic regression model used to estimate prevalence ratios.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}